              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukammbika Joshua mwana wa Nuni kazinyi na kughamba, “Kukaie ing'oni jimange; angu kuchawingira wana wa Israeli andenyi ya ijo isanga nilaghirie nichawineka; ini nichakaia andwamweri na oho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
