          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Musa wameria kuandika chuonyi malagho ghose putu gha sharia ihi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukawilaghira Walawi awo weredukagha Sanduku ya ilaghano ja BWANA ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wadenyi ichi chuo cha sharia, mchiwike mbai na mbai ya Sanduku ya ilaghano ja BWANA Mlungu onyu, chipate kukaia aho chikishuhudia aighu yenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu naichi seji mghilikie; wandu msesikiragha. Kamanya mwawuyamlegha BWANA niko moyo dikwanye, ni kuchumba saki iji nafwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwanyienyi waghosi wose wa vichuku venyu na wabaa wenyu, eri nipate kughora agha malagho wikisikira, na kuwanga mlungunyi na ndoenyi rikaie washahidi aighu yawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu namanya loli nyuma ya kufwa kwapo, mchazama na kuisigha nambai iyo chia neremlaghirieghe; na kwa matuku ghichagha mchapatwa ni mawiwi, angu mchabonya kiwiwi imbiri ya BWANA, na kwa kazi renyu, mcham'bonya ujoko ni machu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
